WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.235
"Zippy is mean," Eddy thought.

2
00:00:17.236 --> 00:00:26.614
He drove away from Zippy.

3
00:00:26.615 --> 00:00:32.017
Eddy watched the busy spaceport.

4
00:00:32.018 --> 00:00:41.835
A fuel truck drove by.

5
00:00:41.836 --> 00:00:49.938
"I'm bringing fuel to Rocky!"

6
00:00:49.939 --> 00:00:58.748
"Let's meet Rocky," Ms. Fender said.

7
00:00:58.749 --> 00:01:05.784
They drove over to the rocket.

8
00:01:05.785 --> 00:01:09.602
Eddy blinked.

9
00:01:09.603 --> 00:01:14.203
Rocky was huge!

10
00:01:14.204 --> 00:01:17.273
"Hi, kids!" Rocky said.

11
00:01:17.274 --> 00:01:20.803
"Will you watch me blast off?"

12
00:01:20.804 --> 00:01:26.186
"Yes!" everyone yelled.

13
00:01:26.187 --> 00:01:31.608
"My job is important," Rocky said.

14
00:01:31.609 --> 00:01:35.364
"I'm bringing things to space."

15
00:01:35.365 --> 00:01:38.999
"How will you do that?" Jeb asked.

16
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:47.713
"My engine is strong," Rocky said.

17
00:01:47.714 --> 00:01:51.758
"I can fly very fast."

18
00:01:51.759 --> 00:01:55.156
"I'm fast too," Zippy said.

19
00:01:55.157 --> 00:01:57.864
"Watch this!"

20
00:01:57.865 --> 00:02:00.270
Zippy sped off.

21
00:02:00.271 --> 00:02:01.452
Zoom!

22
00:02:01.453 --> 00:02:11.153
He shot across the spaceport.

23
00:02:11.154 --> 00:02:14.097
"Uh-oh," Eddy said.

24
00:02:14.098 --> 00:02:17.972
"Zippy is breaking the rules."

25
00:02:17.973 --> 00:02:21.695
Ms. Fender beeped her horn.

26
00:02:21.696 --> 00:02:27.084
"No speeding, Zippy!"

